  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your study of anatomy allows you to strike telling blows.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Anatomical Precision<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat as a swift action, adding your mythic tier as a bonus on your Knowledge skill to identify a creature’s anatomy. You can use this ability as a full-round action to study the anatomy of a number of creatures within 30 feet equal to your Intelligence modifier plus your mythic tier. When you confirm a critical hit or make a successful sneak attack against a creature you have studied with this feat, you can expend one use of your mythic power as a free action to roll all damage dice twice and select the better result against that creature until the end of your turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
